{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Chuck Bonesteel & The Alien Apocalpyse",
    "steam_appid": 3098780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHUCK BONESTEEL: Earth's Last Hope</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098780/extras/81bf429ac54f51e28f8e970c3426c1fa.avif?t=1751943977\" width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Earth's armies shattered and humanity enslaved, one man refuses to kneel: CHUCK BONESTEEL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of 1986's ultimate action hero and take back Earth in this retro roguelike shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murder horde after horde of gib-filled aliens in intense, old-school combat. Grind your way through 20 waves while collecting meaty upgrades along the way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab loot to upgrade permanent stats and fulfill your destiny as Earth's ultimate savior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098780/extras/9cc867fdefae9d248c64ee2bfbe2196a.avif?t=1751943977\" width=800 height=383 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Brutal, juicy combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Short, fast-paced runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chunky upgrades between waves ensure each run is unique and unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blast aliens to collect loot and buy permanent stat boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Straightforward upgrade system = less thinking and more shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 70 face-melting metal tracks to fuel your rampage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgradeable mullet</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHUCK BONESTEEL: Earth's Last Hope</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098780/extras/81bf429ac54f51e28f8e970c3426c1fa.avif?t=1751943977\" width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Earth's armies shattered and humanity enslaved, one man refuses to kneel: CHUCK BONESTEEL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of 1986's ultimate action hero and take back Earth in this retro roguelike shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murder horde after horde of gib-filled aliens in intense, old-school combat. Grind your way through 20 waves while collecting meaty upgrades along the way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab loot to upgrade permanent stats and fulfill your destiny as Earth's ultimate savior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098780/extras/9cc867fdefae9d248c64ee2bfbe2196a.avif?t=1751943977\" width=800 height=383 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Brutal, juicy combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Short, fast-paced runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chunky upgrades between waves ensure each run is unique and unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blast aliens to collect loot and buy permanent stat boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Straightforward upgrade system = less thinking and more shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 70 face-melting metal tracks to fuel your rampage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgradeable mullet</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Shoot, loot, upgrade, repeat. Fast-paced, gib-filled, over-the-top arcade shooter with stripped-down roguelike gameplay.",
